  (text "What this does: Shows the proposed low-current check for whether each external load is connected.\nConnects to: External load pairs -> test/return resistors -> divider on 06f -> flight ADC. Test and return resistors are 3.9k, safe for an igniter with a no-fire current of 25 mA or more."
